\details{
The corrected estimate is
\deqn{\tilde\beta_{\sigma^2} = \hat\beta_{\sigma^2}
       - k\,(\hat\beta_\mu^2 - \mathrm{se}_\mu^2),\qquad k = \mu_3/\mathrm{Var}(g) = 1 - 2p,}
